<app-header title="发现问题" />
<view class="page"><product-card product="{{product}}"/><view class="section-title">请选择问题类型 <text class="muted">（可多选）</text></view><view class="chip-wrap"><text wx:for="{{issueItems}}" wx:key="label" class="chip {{item.active?'active':''}}" data-label="{{item.label}}" bindtap="toggleIssue">{{item.active?'✓ ':''}}{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="card"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">实际到货数量</text><input class="input" value="1880"/><text>斤</text></view><text class="muted">订购数量：2,000斤　|　短缺：120斤</text><view class="section-title">问题说明</view><textarea class="textarea" value="现场过磅实际到货1,880斤，比订单少120斤，请核实处理。" maxlength="200"/></view><view class="section-title">上传照片或视频 <text class="muted">（至少1张）</text></view><view class="photo-grid"><view class="photo-tile"><image src="/assets/evidence-scale.png" mode="aspectFill"/></view><view class="photo-tile"><image src="/assets/evidence-tomato.png" mode="aspectFill"/></view><view class="upload" bindtap="addEvidence">📷<text>上传凭证</text></view></view><view class="card between"><text class="strong">申请扣款金额</text><text class="price">¥240.00　›</text></view><button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" bindtap="submit">提交售后申请</button></view>
